[anyone, "legate_sq_1_29", [], "This is how even the proudest nations can be erased from history - not by senseless, barbaric slaughter, but by making their mother language richer with foreign words; by willingly embracing foreign literature and religion; by kisses from a foreign lover. Of course, in such a relation, both sides earn something beneficial. The assimilated earns better living standards; while the assimilator gains an ally to call upon.", "legate_sq_1_30", [] ],
